rgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-04T02:10:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T23:44:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nNot reproducible in: 4.7.2, 4.8.0-dev1, 4.8.0-dev2\nReproducible in: 4.8.0-dev3, 4.8.0-dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 28 Aug 2026 11:45:06 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors (2560x1440 @ 170.00 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 165.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (nvidia; 610.57.04) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.26 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono) KDE Plasma 6.7.4\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis issue is basically a continuation/reversal of #122748, where the author described the issue as being fixed on 4.8.0-dev2, however this has since regressed and is now affecting dev3 and dev4.\n\nWhen attempting to constrain the mouse via mouse_mode = MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED, the mouse will never actually be constrained and is free to leave the window. \n\nThis is despite #120647 being merged into these versions (merged in June, but these builds are from August)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP, click on the window while the game is embedded in Wayland mode. The mouse should be capable of leaving the window and generally just not being constrained. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MouseConstraintMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31816253/MouseConstraintMRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123164/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123164/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}